        {
          "text": "Abairu muhurrege bakama banyu ab'omunsi omu byona. Kandi eki muleke kukikora obu baba babataireho eriiso, nk'abarukwenda kusiimwa abantu; baitu mubaheereze n'omutima gumu nimutiina MUKAMA. ",
